# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# IMPORTANT — READ THIS BEFORE CHANGING ANYTHING IN HERE
#
# The repository this folder sits in (lash-lan/personal-website) is PUBLIC on
# GitHub. Anything committed here is readable by anyone on the internet, for
# ever, even if it is deleted later.
#
# The Scicom policies, the forms, the cost figures and your task data are
# company material, and one of the supplied files contains a named person's
# passport number, bank account number and home address. None of it goes into
# git. The rules below keep it out.
#
# This costs you nothing: the system was always meant to be moved by copying
# the whole folder, not by cloning it. Git holds the code only.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Scicom policies and forms — company documents, some with personal data in them
resources/
templates/converted/

# Your live data: tasks, finance records, rules, the master list
data/*
!data/.gitkeep

# Generated files and backups
exports/*
!exports/.gitkeep

# Office lock files
~$*
.~lock.*
